{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>素有「牙醫界林志玲」、「台灣最美牙醫」封號的牙醫劉芷伊，憑藉亮眼外型、專業形象與自然幽默的個人魅力，在社群平台累積大批忠實粉絲，全平台追蹤人數突破80萬。如今她跨界推出人生第一本實體寫真集「芷想靠近你：劉芷伊醫師寫真」，以台灣首本由醫師推出的個人實體寫真集為話題，開放預購後迅速登上博客來即時暢銷排行榜第一名。</p><p>此次寫真特別遠赴日本沖繩取景，透過迷人的海島風光與多樣化造型，呈現劉芷伊不同於平時診間形象的多重魅力。</p><figure><img alt=\"台灣「牙醫界林志玲」劉芷伊首本實體寫真集（Instagram@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186736942323077120643987.jpeg/8-h0vIn5xWNEsvOMyHdftL8qq932zox3W55JHlueSR4\"/><figcaption>台灣「牙醫界林志玲」劉芷伊首本實體寫真集（Instagram@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><p>點擊查看更多台灣「牙醫界林志玲」劉芷伊的靚相：</p><figure><img alt=\"台灣「牙醫界林志玲」劉芷伊（Instagram@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186729480148881408284956.jpeg/OCGsOD0wVE5fsx70tG1xTYHLUphbSN5CSfDaPknw2j4\"/><figcaption>台灣「牙醫界林志玲」劉芷伊（Instagram@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011690808283136943152.png/7rngtcI2mOnZ5ApK6Qxf9xEU-a10y3EH2EHPPthBzz4\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011561309147136758962.png/k5mE1ovxJXuHW9A9VT46khhefkAtxkf5a61Fq2utRas\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011564652138496164098.png/85y9ChFERiBSZfv8UgsQCNUcExTWkW09FEXYCRRF2Ak\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011567382761472953617.png/pTqcucsZPoozndmf3HDYVNRq1YG6qaQeHpQCPB6UAjw\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011569933029376236498.png/f2MVCRUxTz58SqLB6ZnBW_vH7dxz89Alox51EaMedRE\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011572638486528426903.png/GysTLP4K0RI8iP8JhHb0d-vVHBIQ71cFr82ngK_Np4A\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011561443364864760349.png/MDPy-O_QZgEb4TPMHtKyAlAekmutyEGx4l-0iOJftIg\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011564232708096018357.png/T2vN6hxl6gpPJRJ59tdHxVmTAM_Y5tsBXf8tOl3_LTo\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011567282098176607243.png/Y0A_gHJ7iWO8XQr-jMM8rHoarbHYqcQRl7zyg5e88oM\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011569903669248873145.png/YsNPW2QCOnSCzVB3XOypyn6hDD29vCYcqAW0oKgFtKA\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011572017729536810426.png/aQtCyY31_SQtqU8_OChCAXdPycRUgM2wwpU_zsKVP84\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011561032323072793284.png/xAn56JbDWvw7DcFyuU-y8EVXebJ77gq_2VZUeNlWVHg\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011564035575808651879.png/rRbMBWNg87Oa9WNf1sciLSPFCkBCdKw8x4wUHMeMFBw\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011566430654464210465.png/L7Aub_EoU2B1q_oxerF8cU1a80-eOGHfMiPAgzIjwIM\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011568901230592812359.png/t-a3Gf7lijveygCQ_UXXHpbMfgl8GKX3XufEvl7nxL4\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011571145314304216830.png/Aj-02rUETLpLzN2iGgtuveVQMtqRRzRZLgYldC4GJXQ\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011560336068608641357.png/eIcV4Y9Jb4JdSLRruqnD-v79bfNbUdZa3tycXN7cnFw\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011564102684672759136.png/ugOlkW0OVQkRlvV6yGXSDqOYNukRSPArl9xY2ZfcWNk\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011566829113344432765.png/_G_s52UGo6DD6oAzQeqoQEhzulPStTJLosYJvaLGCb0\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011569106751488594360.png/EB3HSpN58rw1QqkmFQJMSQSnK3FxTZUZUqLTOVKi0zk\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025011571526995968240653.png/ZpuFN2DbnXVPAz-TeF4rzvWx0RiekiJsPTeJij03iYo\"/><figcaption>劉芷伊（ig@chavelle_liu）</figcaption></figure><p>從甜美可愛、清新自然到成熟性感，各種風格都在鏡頭前展露無遺。其中最具話題性的莫過於性感醫師袍造型，將象徵專業的白袍與性感元素結合，營造出令人耳目一新的視覺反差，也讓粉絲看見這位美女牙醫截然不同的一面。</p><p>值得注意的是，劉芷伊不僅在社群平台擁有高人氣，在牙科專業領域同樣持續深耕。今年7月，她受邀前往新加坡SARC國際醫學大會，以「陶瓷貼片美學」為主題發表演講，分享牙科美學領域的專業經驗。令人驚喜的是，僅僅相隔3個月，她便以截然不同的身分推出個人性感寫真集。</p><p>劉芷伊過去曾奪得模特兒選秀冠軍，更於2019年受邀遠赴義大利參加國際選美，並獲頒「氣質小姐」頭銜。從模特兒選秀、國際選美舞台到牙科專業領域，再到如今推出個人寫真集，多元經歷也讓她展現出不同於一般醫師的鮮明個人特色。</p><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172577286990336000830629.jpeg/lVXG97LDGnjr1zM4Qao7xOViCOtSa8IDS3m7-kt5u_o\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172580635521323008623701.jpeg/k1TAhq06SoFQl8F3lXvGd1bX3rXc_XcuIv-HEiL_hxI\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578016946032640214097.jpeg/bGh9ybqaDKXw42e8ehhoSVTCEUmKEvqf0JG0y9CRtMs\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578019185922048827094.jpeg/RGB-cRiSLzR5A_K-Chx9BHi20dXWZ2-iJC7O-SQuzvk\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578021367091200354701.jpeg/808HUYavbfAjUA-P1_gZpNJ5-pO2B87cecbQU3nG0FM\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578023493734400068325.jpeg/3nyhmWglrjN3LRISAOelOSa4F-tJTyo02DNRo9gzUaM\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578025515520000629041.jpeg/_YHqDa9CL-ZmEyKobtqnN29cuFLL3kCpChrpmQoa6Zk\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578018539868160954306.jpeg/Fgj5L-ROl62rd6lqGrAvyNriz-QOPvDcQ4gjw0OII8M\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578020549070848870621.jpeg/dMGoqflb6CwlspdlBTdaE5kyHi0eBo6EPuZsXD7mbFw\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578022767988736561038.jpeg/cEMxJrifXcF4Phuoq1MT0hwEEVDZ7eFqzn0ync59Mp0\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578025469251584043529.jpeg/CVt6_5fJyvFXxb7sJpK4Rhf4hjUMk2T2RZhPhEWYT4Q\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578027780444160235908.jpeg/IeQC0Gdyt3gKRjWSXQBBTbEn4GZYwAf2CndqOgp3ajo\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578008817471488052739.jpeg/PXrBI8lVgXftKRThKhk1NVDfJ8JBNaVOMjqo9TI6qPU\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172578011527122944413967.jpeg/ue_9KHnlNzuMjEkKmSHwttLbnLdBQuIiI9YWeiPWFno\"/><figcaption>日本前羽球國手荒木茜羽。（Instagram@bigbaby.akane）</figcaption></figure><p>前主播成通緝犯！薛楷莉詐富商男友判刑確定未到案 北檢通緝至2046年</p><p>蝴蝶姐姐愷樂才生雙胞胎！一句話被猜「拚第4胎」 本人9字急發聲</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:39:40.532483+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1709,"images":37,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:30:17+00:00","fet